answer.worked:
The café is busy when $C(t)>17$.
$$\begin{align*}
12-10\cos\left(\frac{\pi t}{4}\right) &> 17 \\
-10\cos\left(\frac{\pi t}{4}\right) &> 5 \\
\cos\left(\frac{\pi t}{4}\right) &< -\frac{1}{2}
\end{align*}$$
For $0\leq t\leq 8$:
$$\begin{align*}
\frac{2\pi}{3} &< \frac{\pi t}{4} < \frac{4\pi}{3} \\
\frac{8}{3} &< t < \frac{16}{3}
\end{align*}$$
The café is busy strictly after $9{:}40$ am and strictly before $12{:}20$ pm.

